    <header class="public-page-heading"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-dot"></span>FOR DOCTORS</div><h1>Your practice, in view.</h1><p>Coordinate appointment availability, manage patient visits and keep clinical documentation connected.</p><div class="home-hero-actions"><a class="button button-primary home-primary-action" href="${ctx}/doctor/login">Sign in to your doctor workspace <span aria-hidden="true">&#8594;</span></a></div></header>
